WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.585
Tyson and the Chore-Bot 3000

00:00:03.235 --> 00:00:04.614
ONE MORNING...

00:00:04.864 --> 00:00:11.185
“MY ROOM EXPLODED.” “CLEAN YOUR ROOM, PLEASE.” “IT WILL TAKE FOREVER.” “GOOD THING I BUILT...”

00:00:12.035 --> 00:00:17.076
“THE CHORE-BOT 3000!” “GREEN MEANS GO!” “CHORE-BOT READY!” “WHOA.”

00:00:17.926 --> 00:00:20.423
“BEST INVENTION EVER.” “TOO EASY.”

00:00:21.273 --> 00:00:26.124
“THE LIVING ROOM TOO?” “ONE MORE BUTTON...” “TURBO CLEAN MODE!” “UH-OH.”

00:00:26.974 --> 00:00:27.847
“HEY!

00:00:28.097 --> 00:00:31.077
MY PAPER!” “NOT THE PLANT!” “STOP!

00:00:31.327 --> 00:00:33.046
TOO MUCH!” “MUST.

00:00:33.296 --> 00:00:34.214
CLEAN.

00:00:34.464 --> 00:00:35.509
EVERYTHING.”

00:00:36.359 --> 00:00:39.829
“I WILL TURN IT OFF!” “ONE GOOD BONK!” “CLEAN!

00:00:40.079 --> 00:00:41.828
CLEAN!” “TWO?!”

00:00:42.678 --> 00:00:43.638
“CLEAN!

00:00:43.888 --> 00:00:44.784
CLEAN!

00:00:45.034 --> 00:00:47.035
CLEEEAN!” “WHAT HAVE I DONE?”

00:00:47.885 --> 00:00:49.096
“NOT THE DOG!”

00:00:49.946 --> 00:00:50.906
“ARF!”

00:00:51.756 --> 00:00:53.702
“CLEAN THE BOY!” “WAIT!

00:00:53.952 --> 00:00:56.469
NO—” “NEED HELP?” “YES PLEASE.”

00:00:57.319 --> 00:00:58.637
“THE RED BUTTONS!

00:00:58.887 --> 00:01:01.885
BOTH AT ONCE!” “READY?” “ONE...

00:01:02.135 --> 00:01:03.019
TWO...

00:01:03.269 --> 00:01:05.117
THREE!” “CLEAN...

00:01:05.367 --> 00:01:07.206
DONE...” “WHEW!”

00:01:08.056 --> 00:01:09.971
“I GOT THIS.” “CLEAN.

00:01:10.221 --> 00:01:12.357
BY ME.” “...ONE MORE.”
